%% Phase1 / channel / G-15a 创建群聊与角色差异
%% PC client: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/cses-client/src/pages/message-v3/service/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts
%% Helix owners: crates/helix-im/src/ws/handlers/channel_created.rs; port_reply/dispatch_channel_create.rs; event/channel.rs
%% 证据边界：HTTP 2xx 和 invokeAccepted 只代表 admission；本地 .v1 artifact 与三端 consumer 当前 NOT_VERIFIED/NOT_SYNCED_BY_SCOPE。
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: createChannel({type,userIds,displayName})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_create_channel", payload)
    Native->>E: serialize -> Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_create_channel", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_create_channel", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 tenant/type/userIds，注入 actor 与 corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/create
  Host->>Go: HTTP create channel
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不发布 created 终态）
  Note over IM,Go: accepted 只说明请求已被服务端接收，频道事实仍等待 WS authority

  Go-->>WS: WS action=channel_created(channel, members, event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(Bytes)
  E->>IM: dispatch_ws_frame(channel_created)
  IM->>IM: 按 channel_id/event_seq 做 authority、scope、重复闸门
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(channel + channel_member + cursor)
  Host->>DB: 单事务写频道、成员角色、viewer-local cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(corr, PersistOk/PersistErr)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(corr)
  E->>IM: route matching PortReply

  alt PersistOk
    IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet channel/member
    Host->>DB: 复合键读回 owner/invitee 绝对态
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit im:channel:created(data)
    IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit im:channel:members(data)
    Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ -> events$（owner/member 角色差异）
    Sink-->>FFI: EventBatch raw DomainEvent bytes
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch v2 raw DomainEvent bytes
  else PersistErr / stale duplicate
    IM-->>Sink: 不 Emit created/members；保留 error 或 no-op
  end
  Note over UI,Web: owner 看到 OWNER actions，invitee 看到 MEMBER；shell 只消费 {event,data}，不重算角色。
